<title>UK: NWE gasoline soft, Eurograde trades $198-$202.</title>
<headline>NWE gasoline soft, Eurograde trades $198-$202.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>NWE gasoline was steady to weaker on Friday, traders said.</p>
<p>Eurograde barges traded at $198 fob ARA in the morning, and also at $200, $201 and $202.</p>
<p>Cargo talk was thin and dealers said it would be hard to work arbitrage business to the United States at current numbers.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 8167</p>
